t mirrors the federal stores (year-12-or-less over G01's six printed stated schooling levels; G07 Tot-row Indigenous/Indigenous-plus-non-Indigenous; G14's Religion menu ten shares (rel, key order in relKeys) over the ex-affiliation-not-stated persons basis; G37's Housing-tenure menu four shares (ten, key order in tenKeys) over the ex-tenure-not-stated occupied-private-dwellings basis; G32's one-parent share of families; the under-15 share of the stated ages). p is census persons; n the SA1 count. The four SA sentinel SA1s (migratory/offshore) carry no polygon and sit outside the join, holding 3389 persons statewide."}